    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97806" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγ-κλάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>break, break off</i>, 
